            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Terpasang"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installed system-wide. Changing them needs admin rights (coming with Spaceroom's helper).": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Terpasang untuk seluruh sistem. Mengubahnya butuh hak admin (hadir bersama helper Spaceroom)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installer downloads you no longer need": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unduhan installer yang tidak Anda perlukan lagi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installers · %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installer · %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It checks Downloads, Desktop, Documents, iCloud Drive and your Applications folder by reading file headers. Nothing is opened or run. This isn't an antivirus: it spots common disguises, not every threat. macOS's own XProtect keeps running alongside it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pemindaian memeriksa Unduhan, Desktop, Dokumen, iCloud Drive, dan folder Aplikasi Anda dengan membaca header file. Tidak ada yang dibuka atau dijalankan. Ini bukan antivirus: ia mengenali penyamaran umum, bukan setiap ancaman. XProtect bawaan macOS tetap berjalan di sampingnya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It frees up in %lld days, or now if you're sure.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ruangnya kosong dalam %lld hari, atau sekarang jika Anda yakin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It keeps running in the menu bar after you close the window. Open it at login so nothing is missed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spaceroom tetap berjalan di bar menu setelah jendela ditutup. Buka saat login agar tidak ada yang terlewat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It moves to the Restore Center, so you can bring it back for %lld days.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Item ini dipindah ke Pusat Pemulihan, jadi Anda bisa mengembalikannya selama %lld hari."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Items kept in the Restore Center still use space for %lld days, so this won't help a full disk until then.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Item yang disimpan di Pusat Pemulihan masih memakai ruang selama %lld hari, jadi ini tidak membantu disk yang penuh sampai saat itu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its name says photo or document, but its contents are a program. Real files never do this.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Namanya bilang foto atau dokumen, tapi isinya program. File asli tidak pernah begini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its run history stays in the list below": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Riwayat jalannya tetap ada di daftar di bawah"
          }
        }
      }
    },
