      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Status Sistem"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System junk, developer junk and Trash in one scan": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sampah sistem, sampah developer, dan Tong Sampah dalam satu pemindaian"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Takes a minute or two": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Butuh satu atau dua menit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The ignore list can't be read, so cleaning is off until it's fixed: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Daftar abaikan tidak bisa dibaca, jadi pembersihan dimatikan sampai diperbaiki: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The ignore list can't be read, so cleaning is off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Daftar abaikan tidak bisa dibaca, jadi pembersihan dimatikan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The list of files you downloaded (not the files)": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Daftar file yang Anda unduh (bukan file-nya)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The name is built so the real type is easy to miss, a common trick to get you to open it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Namanya dibuat agar jenis aslinya mudah terlewat, trik umum agar Anda membukanya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The program isn't signed by a known developer": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Programnya tidak ditandatangani developer yang dikenal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The program it starts no longer exists": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Program yang dijalankannya sudah tidak ada"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved file couldn't be read, so nothing runs and nothing is overwritten. %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "File yang tersimpan tidak bisa dibaca, jadi tidak ada yang berjalan dan tidak ada yang ditimpa. %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thermal state reported by macOS": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Status suhu yang dilaporkan macOS"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These belong to apps that are no longer installed. They move to the Restore Center first, so you can put them back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ini milik aplikasi yang sudah tidak terpasang. Semuanya dipindah ke Pusat Pemulihan dulu, jadi Anda bisa mengembalikannya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These change system-wide settings. They'll run once Spaceroom's privileged helper is installed; until then, nothing is done behind your back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ini mengubah pengaturan seluruh sistem. Tugas ini akan berjalan setelah helper Spaceroom terpasang; sampai saat itu, tidak ada yang dilakukan diam-diam."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These items leave the Restore Center for good and their space is freed right away.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Item ini keluar dari Pusat Pemulihan untuk selamanya dan ruangnya langsung kosong."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They leave your folders now and can be restored for %lld days if one turns out to be fine.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Semuanya keluar dari folder Anda sekarang dan bisa dipulihkan selama %lld hari jika ternyata ada yang aman."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They move to the Restore Center first, so you can put them back for %lld days.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Semuanya dipindah ke Pusat Pemulihan dulu, jadi Anda bisa mengembalikannya selama %lld hari."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They move to the Restore Center, so you can bring them back for %lld days.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Semuanya dipindah ke Pusat Pemulihan, jadi Anda bisa mengembalikannya selama %lld hari."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Things you typed into web forms": {
