        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS %lld.%lld.%lld · menyala %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS doesn't let apps delete some protected items in place, such as apps inside caches. Spaceroom moved them to the Trash instead. Empty the Trash in Finder to free the space.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS tidak mengizinkan aplikasi menghapus beberapa item yang dilindungi di tempatnya, seperti aplikasi di dalam cache. Spaceroom memindahkannya ke Tong Sampah. Kosongkan Tong Sampah di Finder untuk mengosongkan ruangnya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS keeps this list private, so it's managed in System Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS menjaga daftar ini tetap privat, jadi pengelolaannya di Pengaturan Sistem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS protects some folders, such as Trash, Mail and Safari data. Spaceroom needs access to measure and clean them. It never reads the contents of your documents.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS melindungi beberapa folder, seperti Tong Sampah, Mail, dan data Safari. Spaceroom perlu akses untuk mengukur dan membersihkannya. Spaceroom tidak pernah membaca isi dokumen Anda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS protects this data until you allow it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS melindungi data ini sampai Anda mengizinkannya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
